# Changelog for harbour-gtgram; mb2 includes this file in the RPM.
#
# Add newest entries to the top, separated from each other by a blank line:
# * date Author's Name <author's email> version-release
# - Summary of changes

* Fri Sep 11 2026 Guillermo Torres <guillermo.torresbelando@mailfence.com> 0.18-53
- First GTgram release, based on Fernschreiber 0.18
- Installs as a separate package with its own data, launcher entry and icon
- Chat category tabs in the overview: All, Private, Groups, Channels
- Reply and react directly from notifications
- Edit and delete messages work with the bundled TDLib 1.8.62
- Forward messages silently
- Pull up at the end of a chat to open the next unread chat
